"Use the substitution $u=x^{2}$. Which integral is obtained?\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}} 2 x e^{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}} 2 x e^{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679585 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ff9f14c6-e7db-596d-9618-7617d39ec406" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{80}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679629}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ff9f14c6-e7db-596d-9618-7617d39ec406" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{80}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679629} :answer-field/id #uuid "c496f9ed-0027-5df2-9228-5afcf3c033e4" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679603}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "90f1394b-b3e3-58ff-b7a5-aad48e825ede" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} 4 \\cdot 5^{x + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C$.\n\n{{answer}}" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} 4 \\cdot 5^{x + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int_{1}^{2} 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right]_{1}^{2}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\frac{25}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{5}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{80}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679587 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65be0e3e-ffb9-5082-8469-f46219ca3e10" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\left(\\ln\\left(7\\right)-\\ln\\left(5\\right)\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679571}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "65be0e3e-ffb9-5082-8469-f46219ca3e10" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\left(\\ln\\left(7\\right)-\\ln\\left(5\\right)\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679571} :answer-field/id #uuid "b2f64048-00f5-5c3b-9ce2-109de29f04b3" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679596}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "98ccf776-cbef-59ff-bad2-21baea608c07" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{6 e^{x}}{2 e^{x} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{\\ln 3}=3$.\n\n{{answer}}" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 e^{x} + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{x})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=5\\\\x=\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{6 e^{x}}{2 e^{x} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int_{5}^{7} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\left[\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right]_{5}^{7}\\right)=3\\left(\\left(\\ln{\\left(7 \\right)}\\right)-\\left(\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\ln\\left(7\\right)-\\ln\\left(5\\right)\\right).\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679589 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f411cee-34cd-5e43-b660-895da178df5a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4\\left(\\int_{1}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 1} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679546} {:answer/id #uuid "36a8e2f7-f978-534f-b874-d1e004a7aaa5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\left(\\int_{1}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 1} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679549} {:answer/id #uuid "4f1a2b97-8de2-52e4-9533-56f22bb26d91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12\\left(\\int_{1}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 1} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679562} {:answer/id #uuid "6cf6996d-5ec3-584e-975c-587892f7556a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8\\left(\\int_{1}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 1} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679575} {:answer/id #uuid "d3ba5524-fc3d-50c8-a2c1-9c249c0f62ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\left(\\int_{1}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 1} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679608}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d3ba5524-fc3d-50c8-a2c1-9c249c0f62ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\left(\\int_{1}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)} + 1} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679608} :answer-field/id #uuid "e1f809ca-a5d1-58af-9fdd-380bbfa03d9f" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type