\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}} 2 x e^{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} e^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683206 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "33815bee-7119-5572-94c9-72f36586f2e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{72}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683221}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "33815bee-7119-5572-94c9-72f36586f2e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{72}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683221} :answer-field/id #uuid "119f5306-f073-5d16-91d6-d7cdf25e2a75" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683215}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "012021b3-4d85-5cb3-8311-8b799e8be032" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} 4 \\cdot 3^{2 x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x^{2} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=2\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} 4 \\cdot 3^{2 x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{2}^{4} 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\right]_{2}^{4}=\\left(\\frac{81}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{9}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{72}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683211 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d3a8f371-e5ae-5720-b7bb-d3e191025cfd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{18}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683248}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d3a8f371-e5ae-5720-b7bb-d3e191025cfd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{18}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683248} :answer-field/id #uuid "05f3173b-ff5e-514c-8652-b030ac2dcf48" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683208}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0cb8ac52-0d5a-5929-9f99-bdc30485bce9" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} 3^{2 x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x^{2} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=2\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} 3^{2 x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int_{2}^{4} 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\left[\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\right]_{2}^{4}\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\left(\\frac{81}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{9}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{18}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683214 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f77e899-5bf3-5606-be9d-9e74679a05f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683220}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2f77e899-5bf3-5606-be9d-9e74679a05f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683220} :answer-field/id #uuid "9d0908c6-1508-50e9-9268-c0821dfd898f" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683239}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1100c904-712f-5524-964a-421be8478f15" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} 2^{x + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} 2^{x + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{1}^{2} 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{2^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{2^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right]_{1}^{2}=\\left(\\frac{4}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{2}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683216 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8edcdcf5-ee8a-538c-96af-d2101e4899ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683236}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8edcdcf5-ee8a-538c-96af-d2101e4899ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683236} :answer-field/id #uuid "b2e12dce-8af3-5074-96bb-3236a1bf09ab" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683241}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "16af13da-5b4a-5b74-9587-06e182b98c33" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} 2 \\cdot 2^{2 x^{2} + 1} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x^{2} + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} 2 \\cdot 2^{2 x^{2} + 1} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{1}^{3} 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{2^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[\\frac{2^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right]_{1}^{3}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(\\frac{8}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{2}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683217 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "33ffd842-c0f4-5dd4-ae37-55555a0a18c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683222}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "33ffd842-c0f4-5dd4-ae37-55555a0a18c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683222} :answer-field/id #uuid "03fb0ade-496a-5432-8405-4871628eba76" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683207}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "19de1ca2-28f1-5ffe-a86a-3f6bc8444a83" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} 2^{2 x + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=2\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} 2^{2 x + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{2}^{4} 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{2^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[\\frac{2^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right]_{2}^{4}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(\\frac{16}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{4}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{6}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683218 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "09a01de8-9d9c-5eb5-9613-f7cc12bde92f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\left(\\ln\\left(5\\right)-\\ln\\left(4\\right)\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683210}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "09a01de8-9d9c-5eb5-9613-f7cc12bde92f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\left(\\ln\\left(5\\right)-\\ln\\left(4\\right)\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683210} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc043b8a-cadd-581c-9912-a629a4453c91" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683245}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "288c851f-3131-5632-91b4-c054d25eb62c" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{3 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=e^{x} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=4\\\\x=\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{3 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int_{4}^{5} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{\\ln 3}=3$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\left[\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right]_{4}^{5}\\right)=3\\left(\\left(\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}\\right)-\\left(\\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\ln\\left(5\\right)-\\ln\\left(4\\right)\\right).\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683219 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "63803f38-d4f4-51fb-b926-c0a17e394dd1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\left(\\ln\\left(4\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683229}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "63803f38-d4f4-51fb-b926-c0a17e394dd1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\left(\\ln\\left(4\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683229} :answer-field/id #uuid "08caccc4-9c2f-58fb-8975-52cd7a1ff3a4" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683209}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "2963665c-c27d-5066-9d24-fca8da38a3ed" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{4 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"